{
  "name": "Piercing Thorns",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your command of primal magic allows you to enhance your attacks with thorns. Once during each of your turns, you can deal an additional 1d6 piercing damage to one creature you hit with a weapon attack. This damage increases to 2d6 when your reach 11th level in this class.</p><p>If your weapon counts as magical for the purpose of overcoming Resistance and Immunity to nonmagical attacks and damage, this damage does as well.</p>",
